4·美的集团ESG报告</div>\n      <nav class=\"nav\">\n        <span>关于本报告</span>\n        <span>走进美的</span>\n        <span>可持续发展治理</span>\n        <span>守护蓝色星球</span>\n        <span>构建和谐社区</span>\n        <span class=\"active\">践行科技尽善</span>\n        <span>共创繁荣生态</span>\n        <span>附录</span>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"pages\">\n      <article class=\"page quality\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\">\n          <span class=\"section-icon\"><i></i><b></b></span>\n          <span>品质属性</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"panel\">\n          <div class=\"subheading\">耐用性提升：美的COLMO电热水器</div>\n          <p class=\"body-copy\">\n            该产品创新性将高分子材料应用于热水器的内胆中，并搭载Ti钛金抗腐层，其内胆脉冲寿命为传统搪<br>\n            瓷内胆的40倍，耐腐蚀性能比上一代产品提高一倍以上。\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"placeholder main-image\">[产品图：美的COLMO电热水器及内胆技术演进图]</div>\n          <p class=\"caption\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>美的COLMO电热水器</p>\n\n          <div class=\"quality-grid\">\n            <section class=\"small-card\">\n              <div class=\"subheading\">耐候性提升：石墨烯涂层空调</div>\n              <p class=\"body-copy\">\n                该产品使用长效防腐耐候石墨烯涂层，使铝箔<br>\n                耐中性盐雾时长延长至300%，热扩散系数提<br>\n                升31%，耐候性提升4倍，获得Intertek长效防<br>\n                腐最高等级认定和国际顶刊《Nature》专题<br>\n                报道。\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"evidence-row\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder certificate\">[认证证书]</div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder report\">[《Nature》专题报道]</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"small-captions\">\n                <div><span class=\"dot\"></span>Intertek长效<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;防腐最高等级认定</div>\n                <div><span class=\"dot\"></span>《Nature》专题报道</div>\n              </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section class=\"small-card\">\n              <div class=\"subheading\">智能设计：美的COLMO射频嵌入式蒸汽烤箱</div>\n              <p class=\"body-copy\">\n                该产品应用前沿的固态射频微波技术并结合先<br>\n                进的模式识别叠加算法，实现微波精准定向输<br>\n                出，使加热均匀性提升50%。\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"oven-row\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder oven\">[产品图：美的COLMO<br>射频嵌入式蒸汽烤箱]</div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder certificate-small\">[科学技术成果<br>鉴定证书]</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"oven-captions\">\n                <div><span class=\"dot\"></span>美的COLMO射频<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;嵌入式蒸汽烤箱</div>\n                <div><span class=\"dot\"></span>科学技术成果<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;鉴定证书</div>\n              </div>\n            </section>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"page-number left-number\">91</div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"page environment\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\">\n          <span class=\"section-icon\"><i></i><b></b></span>\n          <span>环境属性</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"panel\">\n          <div class=\"subheading\">降低污染物排放：美的滚筒系列洗衣机</div>\n          <p class=\"body-copy\">\n            该系列产品应用全球首创的超微净泡及蓝氧技术，实现洗涤剂用量减少50%，能够有效降低洗涤剂造成<br>\n            的水足迹<sup>6</sup>。该系列产品已获得中国轻工业联合会科技进步奖、年度艾普兰优秀产品奖、革新产品金选<br>\n            奖、健康洗护之星等众多荣誉。\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"placeholder main-image\">[产品图：美的滚筒系列洗衣机]</div>\n          <p class=\"caption\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>美的滚筒系列洗衣机</p>\n\n          <div class=\"bottom-environment\">\n            <section>\n              <div class=\"subheading\">减少毒害物质产生：美的缤色系列集成灶SP3</div>\n              <p class=\"body-copy\">\n                该系列产品采用可换向直排风道和多重油烟分离<br>\n                净烟设计，实现油烟PM2.5低至32 μg/m³，获<br>\n                得一级净烟认证。\n              </p>\n            </section>\n            <section>\n              <div class=\"placeholder rangehood\">[产品图：美的缤色系列集成灶SP3<br>及一级净烟认证]</div>\n              <p class=\"range-caption\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>美的缤色系列集成灶SP3</p>\n            </section>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"footnote\">\n          <sup>6</sup> 根据评估，应用超微净泡及蓝氧技术的已出售洗衣机产品每年可有效降低洗涤剂造成的水可用性足迹5.76百万 m³depriv.、水酸化足迹258075mol H+eq、淡水富营养化足迹11.84tPeq、海水富营养化足迹183.15tNeq、淡水生态毒性足迹1.39/ZCTUe。\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"page-number right-number\">92</div>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
